CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeScripts/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
CPackConfig.cmake
CPackSourceConfig.cmake
install_manifest.txt
_deps/
compile_commands.json.bak

